{"body":{"branch_id":"B2","constraint_refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:42d39444f18221d84c4122c226f20c16c341dd23f47ce3bfecff2e4f06b07127","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:50be47c5e4cc355380774740e9dcb5904fd012070d37f026e2d3a4749191c5f1","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:037124eb5fb85e2ec6ec34b0076d7079f37c2e838128c19c780c11d93d9adbbf","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:1686c152563a0b007380a89dbd4fd8dbc8e58cc8508faf4f037ba91031b5e580","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:a2bf4e2c753a1df7323156aeb8ceda9306129eeec726882cdd97ef6e8d2778a6","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:0cd851983ce9e268acc0bf66672c857e66063a1e878114e3febca93820a67665","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}],"creator_operation_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:845417a5c1eb06c73d0f52dce41680721f0d4fdc55eeacd2b3f5b00c8d3906e8","kind":"operation","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"description":"The settlement commits early to a production plan of four conductive rods and two insulating panels, intending to use all six catalyst units. The kiln begins sequential firing. The first four firings each produce one conductive rod, permanently consuming four catalyst units and leaving the settlement with four rods, no panels, and two catalyst units. Before the remaining firings occur, construction priorities change: the work now under consideration would benefit more from insulating panels than from additional rods. The settlement can redirect the two unfired catalyst units, but it cannot recover the four units already embodied in rods or convert those rods into panels. It therefore uses the fifth and sixth firings to produce insulating panels. After all six sequential firings, the settlement has four rods and two panels with no catalyst remaining. The original allocation has failed as an adaptable arrangement because most of the finite resource was irreversibly committed before later needs became apparent. The settlement can still use the existing rods and ordinary construction materials elsewhere, but any work requiring more than the two available panels must proceed without additional kiln-produced panels or be postponed or redesigned around the available stock. The failure does not arise from exceeding the catalyst supply or producing two parts simultaneously; it arises from committing irreversible production too early, leaving later information unable to change most of the allocation.","facts":{"catalyst_units":0,"panels":2,"rods":4},"intelligence_response_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:2d7e64f496ebd194a7ecd80b4d503cd6fc3aeb19f1309966a89f59454380d40e","kind":"intelligence_response","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"rule_set_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:143393f98376b5cea7eee0cfb146a7428c2ad78e27d793c4d74b092d7ecc5d66","kind":"rule_set","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"seed_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:d760920717ec860b430e08ea8b793072d1bdbb427556e32f1fec8fb5eaed984c","kind":"seed","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}},"canonicalization_version":"eidomancer.jcs.v1","claim_class":"generated_candidate","kind":"world_state","provenance":{"actor_role":"environment","identification_status":"declared","input_refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:845417a5c1eb06c73d0f52dce41680721f0d4fdc55eeacd2b3f5b00c8d3906e8","kind":"operation","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:2d7e64f496ebd194a7ecd80b4d503cd6fc3aeb19f1309966a89f59454380d40e","kind":"intelligence_response","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}],"model_or_v